1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,403
2,000 resumes. 20 seats. Which
ones can actually code?

2
00:00:03,453 --> 00:00:05,427
A degree and a resume don't tell you.

3
00:00:06,127 --> 00:00:10,233
Scan a Qubirex Capability Passport. The QR
code opens the student's record,

4
00:00:10,283 --> 00:00:12,007
and the badge shows it is valid.

5
00:00:12,707 --> 00:00:16,768
See every skill the student proved,
the evidence behind it,

6
00:00:16,818 --> 00:00:19,904
and the fresh check they
passed on their own.

7
00:00:19,954 --> 00:00:23,807
The page confirms the passport is
genuine and unchanged.

8
00:00:24,507 --> 00:00:28,439
Search candidates by proven
skill, across colleges.

9
00:00:28,489 --> 00:00:34,762
Each one shows a readiness score for the role,
and the skills they have verified.

10
00:00:35,462 --> 00:00:39,618
See who is ready, what each one
is still missing,

11
00:00:39,668 --> 00:00:43,394
and invite them to interview
with one click.

12
00:00:44,094 --> 00:00:49,088
Signed records, that can't be edited.
Fresh checks, taken without help.

13
00:00:49,138 --> 00:00:54,132
And anyone can verify them in seconds.
Test fewer, test the right ones.

14
00:00:54,832 --> 00:00:57,562
Qubirex. Request candidate access.
